401	        "the real DashboardRemoteDataSource try/catch and "
402	        "DashboardNarrativeDto's generated fromJson to ResourceError"
403	        '(MalformedResponse), never a crash — the local decode-failure '
404	        'path, not Failure.fromCode', () async {
405	      adapter.queueJsonResponse(200, {
406	        'data': {
407	          'text': 'Texto incompleto',
408	          // 'generatedAt' deliberately omitted.
